            <ArticleTitle>Cost-effective endoscopic radial artery harvesting.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>353-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Radial artery harvesting has been routinely performed by endoscopy. We present a reduced cost technique using a reusable retractor and thermal welding shears. The combination of reusable and disposable tools allows patients to benefit from endoscopic radial artery harvesting with decreased morbidity and favorable cosmetic results.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
